    ":question/math-academy-id": "q-37313",
    ":question/problem": "To which of the following sets does the number $\\frac{72}{9}$ belong?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
    ":question/worked-solution": "First, we note that $\\frac{72}{9}=8$ is a natural number, so it belongs to $N.$ \n\nConsequently, $\\frac{72}{9}$ also belongs to ${Q}^{+}$ and $R.$\n\nSince $\\frac{72}{9}$ is positive, it does not belong to ${Q}_{0}^{-}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \u201c$N$ (natural numbers)\u201d; ${Q}^{+}$; \u201c$R$ (real numbers)\u201d only."
  },
